id: pm-2h8t6y
title: "GH-1205: Declare root-only versus inherited extension flag reservation scope"
description: Clarify the published distinction between root help flags and inherited host-reserved subcommand flags. The existing preflight contract deliberately validates SUBCOMMAND_GLOBAL_FLAG_CONTRACTS; root --explain and command-local --explain can represent separate parser positions. Confirm runtime behavior and expose a typed machine-readable reservation scope for package authors without abruptly breaking existing pm-context or pm-brief commands.
